flowchart TD
  U[User: normal typed or spoken language] --> R[Normalise + deterministic fast route]
  R -->|ambiguous/colloquial| I[Structured semantic interpreter]
  R -->|obvious| W[Reviewed application operation]
  I -->|high confidence| W
  I -->|unclear state-changing action| C[Clarify; do not mutate]
  W --> Q{What is needed?}
  Q --> O[FarmPi observation/device state]
  Q --> A[Deterministic analysis/comparison/graph data]
  Q --> M[Confirmed state change + audit]
  Q --> E[External/general explanation]
  O --> P[Label provenance and authority]
  A --> P
  M --> P
  E --> H[Five-tier source hierarchy]
  H --> P
  P --> K{Exact capability available?}
  K -->|yes| X[Useful application response]
  K -->|no| V[Inspect related measurements/operations/graphs]
  V -->|nearby capability| X
  V -->|genuinely ambiguous| C
  V -->|no supported alternative| Z[Concise limitation + available options]
  O -. never invented .-> P
  A -. never delegated to model .-> P
  E -. relevance controls quality/depth, not permission .-> H
